# TypeScript Error Fix Context

When working on TypeScript error fixes:

- Reference: @docs/typescript-fix-plan.md for detailed workflow
- Task tracking: @TYPESCRIPT-FIX-TASKS.md for current progress
- Error report: @typescript-errors-report.json for current state
- Fix plan: @CURSOR-FIX-PLAN.md for generated prompts

## Workflow Steps

1. Run detection: npm run fix:detect
2. Review generated CURSOR-FIX-PLAN.md
3. Use Composer for batch fixes
4. Update TYPESCRIPT-FIX-TASKS.md after each phase
5. Validate: npm run fix:validate
